@startuml
title Aveli — Workspace Access Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
  FontColor black
  DiamondBackgroundColor white
  DiamondBorderColor black
}
skinparam ArrowColor black

start

:Authenticated user;
:Evaluate valid access sources;

if (Lifetime valid?) then (Yes)
  :Resolve access as Lifetime;
elseif (Manual Grant valid?) then (Yes)
  :Resolve access as Manual Grant;
elseif (Subscription valid?) then (Yes)
  :Resolve access as Active Subscription;
elseif (Trial valid?) then (Yes)
  :Resolve access as Active Trial;
else (No)
  :Resolve as No Access;
endif

if (Valid access source exists?) then (Yes)
  :Workspace available;
else (No)
  :Access Gate;
endif

note right
Any valid source unlocks
the same complete workspace.

Priority resolves which source
represents the current access state.
end note

stop

@enduml
